# Keycard answers, resolved with the five-keycard limit. When the answer is
# ambiguous the asker signs off in five of the trump suit and the answerer
# corrects to six with the higher count.
card    21GF-DEFAULT
dealer  S

# seat hand             | auction                              | expect | why
N 8.AQ9732.K94.AKJ      | 1NT P 4D P 4H P 4NT P 5C P           | 5H     | "1 or 4" facing my two: only 1 fits, two are missing
N 8.AQ9732.K94.AKJ      | 1NT P 4D P 4H P 4NT P 5D P           | 5H     | "0 or 3" facing my two: 2 or 5, unresolved: sign off
S AK5.K74.KQ82.A93      | 1NT P 4D P 4H P 4NT P 5D P 5H P      | 6H     | three keycards: correct to six
S KJ5.K74.KQ82.Q93      | 1NT P 4D P 4H P 4NT P 5D P 5H P      | P      | no keycards: accept the sign-off

# When to ask. Same test as standard Blackwood (slam-catch.notes.md); only
# the answers differ. Checked against BBA with `rbb probe` on this card.
S AKQ952.A.AQ865.5      | 1S P 3S P                            | 4NT    | 25 support points opposite a limit raise, 7 controls
S AK9874.A.AQJ54.9      | 1S P 3S P                            | 4NT    | 6-5 with every top card
S AKJ63.T5.Q8.AJT9      | 1S P 3S P                            | 4S     | 15 HCP: game in the fit, no ask

# In a game force the 33 is measured against partner's floor. Opener's
# jump to game over the Jacoby 2NT is a minimum, and responder's own
# support points carry the rest. Corpus hands (Slam_After_Major_Fit)
# where BBA also asks.
N T642.AQJ3.AK93.K      | 1S P 2NT P 4S P                      | 4NT    | 17 HCP and a singleton king facing a game force: 33 between us
N AQT6.Q8762.T.AKQ      | 1H P 2NT P 4H P                      | 4NT    | as above, with the ♦ singleton counted against five trumps
N K985.AQ.AQT.AJ42      | 1S P 2NT P 4S P                      | 4NT    | 20 HCP: no suit is bare, so the keycards are the last question


# The cards that say 0314 (Precision, 21GF-GIB, 21GF-GIB-Bergen): we
# play 1430 anyway (Rick, 2026-09-27); BBA's style plays the card.
card    21GF-DEFAULT slam.blackwood.rkcb_1430=false slam.blackwood.rkcb_0314=true
S AK5.K74.KQ82.A93      | 1NT P 4D P 4H P 4NT P                | 5D     | three keycards, 1430: 5♦
S AKQJT4.A654.KQ9.      | 1S P 2NT P 3C P 4S P                 | 4NT    | on 21GF-GIB-Bergen this hand had no ask at all (Bergen_Raises 65)
card    21GF-DEFAULT slam.blackwood.rkcb_1430=false slam.blackwood.rkcb_0314=true general.style=bba
S AK5.K74.KQ82.A93      | 1NT P 4D P 4H P 4NT P                | 5C     | BBA's style plays the card's 0314: three keycards is 5♣
S KQ5.Q74.KQ82.A93      | 1NT P 4D P 4H P 4NT P                | 5D     | and one keycard is 5♦
N 8.AQ9732.K94.AKJ      | 1NT P 4D P 4H P 4NT P 5D P           | 5H     | "1 or 4" facing my two: only 1 fits, two are missing

# The minor_0314 treatment: 0314 when a minor is trumps, 1430 in the majors.
card    21GF-DEFAULT slam.blackwood.minor_0314=true
S AK5.K74.KQ82.A93      | 1NT P 4D P 4H P 4NT P                | 5D     | hearts are trumps: 1430
N K5.843.K72.AQ852      | 1C P 2C P 4NT P                      | 5D     | clubs are trumps: 0314, one keycard is 5♦
card    21GF-DEFAULT
N K5.843.K72.AQ852      | 1C P 2C P 4NT P                      | 5C     | without the treatment: 1430, one keycard is 5♣
